uring long-distance trips.<\/p>","subhd_color":"#222222","hd_color":"#ffffff","des_color":"#ffffff","use_shadow":false,"button_label":"","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"extra-medium","btn_cl":"light","button_effect":"default"}}},"block_order":["21953fa8-e9b9-40bf-9a4b-84b4822fe41e","7ffe496b-9b2e-4692-829b-0c66923582e8"],"settings":{"design_heading":"1","heading_align":"t4s-text-center","top_heading":"","icon_heading":"las la-gem","top_subheading":"","tophead_mb":30,"space_h_item":"4","space_v_item":"0","space_h_item_mb":"0","space_v_item_mb":"0","layout":"t4s-container-fluid","cl_bg":"#2b2b2b","cl_bg_gradient":"","mg":"","pd":"","mg_mb":"","pd_mb":"","use_cus_css":false,"code_cus_css":""}},"23a47183-7ad7-4945-92c7-d70bcf751346":{"type":"image_text","blocks":{"template--17032844771617__23a47183-7ad7-4945-92c7-d70bcf751346-167075611697aaa1b0-1":{"type":"bl_text","settings":{"col_dk":"5","col_tb":"6","text_size":"40,15","txt_align":"start","sub_heading":"","heading":"Ebike design and Frame materia","text":"<p>The ergonomic design enhances rider comfort, while the streamlined design reduces wind resistance during rides, making for a hassle-free experience!<\/p><p>The high-strength steel frame provides stability, durability and is not easily deformed.<\/p>","subhd_color":"#222222","hd_color":"#ffffff","des_color":"#ffffff","use_shadow":false,"button_label":"","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"extra-medium","btn_cl":"light","button_effect":"default"}},"template--17032844771617__23a47183-7ad7-4945-92c7-d70bcf751346-167075611697aaa1b0-0":{"type":"bl_image","settings":{"image1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC05714_365bce64-0079-4a71-8ef7-8a82563c16dd.jpg","image2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC06881.jpg","col_dk":"7","col_tb":"6","layout_des":"carousel","post_mobile":"default","image_ratio":"ratio3_2","image_size":"cover","image_position":"9","loop":true,"au_time":0,"au_hover":true,"nav_btn":false,"btn_vi":"hover","btn_owl":"default","btn_shape":"none","btn_cl":"dark","btn_size":"small","btn_hidden_mobile":true,"nav_dot":true,"dot_owl":"default","dots_cl":"light","dots_round":true,"dots_space":10,"dots_hidden_mobile":false}}},"block_order":["template--17032844771617__23a47183-7ad7-4945-92c7-d70bcf751346-167075611697aaa1b0-1","template--17032844771617__23a47183-7ad7-4945-92c7-d70bcf751346-167075611697aaa1b0-0"],"settings":{"design_heading":"1","heading_align":"t4s-text-center","top_heading":"","icon_heading":"las la-gem","top_subheading":"","tophead_mb":30,"space_h_item":"4","space_v_item":"0","space_h_item_mb":"0","space_v_item_mb":"0","layout":"t4s-container-fluid","cl_bg":"#2b2b2b","cl_bg_gradient":"","mg":"","pd":"","mg_mb":"","pd_mb":"","use_cus_css":false,"code_cus_css":""}},"a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c":{"type":"feature_columns","blocks":{"template--17032844771617__a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c-1670754134efff77e9-0":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC05521.jpg","title":"48V LED Headlight","text":"<p>High-end headlights, low power consumption, high brightness, wide range, can see everything ahead when driving at night, and play a role in reminding pedestrians and vehicles.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"template--17032844771617__a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c-1670754134efff77e9-1":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"title":"Integrated Brake Rear Light","text":"<p>Whether it is day or night, the light reminder function when braking can keep the rear pedestrians and vehicles at a safe distance. At the same time, the tail lights can also keep on to prevent rear-end collisions at night.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"template--17032844771617__a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c-1670754134efff77e9-2":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC05530.jpg","title":"The Shimano 7-speed Shifter","text":"<p>The high-end version of the seven-speed transmission system can maintain the ideal pedaling pace and torque no matter whether it is climbing, flat road or downhill.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"f2f3354c-bc4e-4d7f-aa3e-1db2687a26b2":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"title":"Mechanical Disc Brakes","text":"<p>Sensitive front and rear disc brakes cooperate with the suspension system to reduce the impact caused by inertia when braking.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"c45f12b7-ddd3-4814-94a7-71cfe4d9a6f5":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC05678.jpg","title":"Extra Long Double Seat","text":"<p>Different from conventional ebikes, macfox has an extra-long comfortable seat and uses PU memory foam to eliminate the fatigue for the rider during long-distance riding.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"950277aa-027b-4e9c-8494-5e3f28f4d693":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"title":"Ergonomic Half Twist Throttle","text":"<p>When tired of pedaling, take a break and cruise. Gently twist the throttle on your right to accelerate.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"505ead31-83a3-43e8-9f16-ea73626a603a":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"title":"Adjustable Saddle","text":"<p>This bike seat is a durable and comfortable saddle that decreases the impact of road bumps. You may adjust your posture by moving the saddle up and down as well as back and forth.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"26058b19-7c3d-4553-8d4f-6b60586ef119":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC05670.jpg","title":"20\"*4.0\" CST Tires","text":"<p>The thick and sturdy tires with knobby tread patterns provide strong grip and traction, even in harsh terrains such as dry land, mud, asphalt, and sand.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"ae6269df-143d-4f81-87eb-9dc771c3f251":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC05679.jpg","title":"Gear Mode","text":"<p>The Macfox-X1 features a rotary plate accelerator mode, which can be used in combination with pedal-assisted riding to achieve optimal energy savings. It also offers three gears for riders to switch at will, providing a customized riding experience.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"d0179f23-a8cb-4df3-997d-e4e287d9f656":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC05575.jpg","title":"Display Screen","text":"<p>The lightweight and compact LCD screen is designed to save energy, displaying speed, mileage, and power information in different gears. It monitors your riding status in real-time, eliminating any anxiety about battery life.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"d190264d-6baf-4cb5-8569-fe78bbfc0613":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"title":"Full Fenders","text":"<p>Fenders on both the front and rear are complete with all of the necessary hardware. They're incredibly resilient and keep you dry and clean from water and mud.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}},"4373572d-e4b6-4589-b21c-dcebf73ef1b9":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"title":"Center Stand","text":"<p>Built with rust-resistant, sturdy, and durable aluminum alloy.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_link":"_blank","btn_icon":false,"button_style":"default","btn_size":"large","btn_cl":"dark","button_effect":"fade"}}},"block_order":["template--17032844771617__a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c-1670754134efff77e9-0","template--17032844771617__a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c-1670754134efff77e9-1","template--17032844771617__a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c-1670754134efff77e9-2","f2f3354c-bc4e-4d7f-aa3e-1db2687a26b2","c45f12b7-ddd3-4814-94a7-71cfe4d9a6f5","950277aa-027b-4e9c-8494-5e3f28f4d693","505ead31-83a3-43e8-9f16-ea73626a603a","26058b19-7c3d-4553-8d4f-6b60586ef119","ae6269df-143d-4f81-87eb-9dc771c3f251","d0179f23-a8cb-4df3-997d-e4e287d9f656","d190264d-6baf-4cb5-8569-fe78bbfc0613","4373572d-e4b6-4589-b21c-dcebf73ef1b9"],"settings":{"design_heading":"1","heading_align":"t4s-text-center","top_heading":"","icon_heading":"las la-gem","top_subheading":"","tophead_mb":30,"text_align":"start","pos_text":"default","fs_title":26,"fs_text":16,"fs_title_mb":22,"fs_text_mb":15,"image_ratio":"ratio16_9","image_